          "type": "su",
          "description": "3/day, a fire gigas roars a fiery cone blast within 30-ft. burst. Any creature within the area of effect takes 10d6 points of fire damage and are inflicted with the Burn status effect for 1d6 rounds. A successful Reflex save (DC 19) reduces the damage by half and negates the status effect. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 5th level spell (Knowledge: Local DC 25).",
